<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective May 30.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     24.07     23.55	  4.26-9.50  4.52-9.76</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     24.07     23.55	  4.07-9.07  4.33-9.33</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     27.41     26.90	 11.53	11.78</p>
<p> White sugar	  27.41     26.90	  7.01	 7.26</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.27	0.27	  0.38	 0.38</p>
</text>
